=== admin_message/new_order push does not fire on rejected paths ===
Static code check: Helpers::send_push_notif_to_topic(...) call sits inside the try{} block
AFTER the write to $order->save(), which is itself after the 403 gate's early return -- the
push call is structurally unreachable on any 403 response (confirmed by reading
OrderController@offline_payment, lines ~828-880). No push/notification log lines were emitted
during any of the 403 calls above (grepped storage/logs/laravel.log for send_push_notif /
new_order around the test window -- none found).
Verdict: PASS (confirmed by code position + absence of log activity)

